__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Identicon constants, regenerated per checkout. Untracked on purpose: it holds
# every rendering variant so that which one to use is the reader's choice, and a
# tracked copy would make one person's screen everybody's default. Being ignored
# also means it does not exist in a fresh worktree until the installer runs
# there, which is why the installer writes it every time.
CLAUDE.local.md
